== Tools
tools/ckcon.py was extended in this run with two directives: `@sleep <s>` and `@poll <s> <regex> <cmd>` (README entry
updated). @poll re-runs <cmd> until its output matches; the time it prints includes the command round trip (~1.2 s/read).
